\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f0444f01-170d-4efe-9a62-343bc580d25e-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5287\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Shopee Express l\u00e0 g\u00ec? D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5, tra b\u01b0u c\u1ee5c, \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"KzYQd3c01oBldQxVk2vl9bOqg1g\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hp8Kd10xSo1JrhxtZhDlai4hgle\"><strong>Shopee Express<\/strong> l\u00e0 \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00e0nh l\u1eadp v\u00e0 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh b\u1edfi ch\u00ednh Shopee. D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 n\u00e0y ra \u0111\u1eddi v\u1edbi m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a quy tr\u00ecnh giao nh\u1eadn, t\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 giao h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 mang l\u1ea1i tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t cho c\u1ea3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-KDnZd6NdwoDjWHxWquZlpezig8o\">\u0110\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt:<\/h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MEYCdstgHouvKbxvrwnl5osfgb3\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u00edch h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n:<\/strong> Shopee Express ch\u1ec9 x\u1eed l\u00fd c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o ra tr\u00ean s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed Shopee.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WThodMnmSo0pOAxjN3GlNdqngN7\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 giao h\u00e0ng nhanh:<\/strong> V\u1edbi h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng kho b\u00e3i v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 nh\u00e2n vi\u00ean giao h\u00e0ng ri\u00eang, Shopee Express c\u00f3 t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 giao h\u00e0ng r\u1ea5t c\u1ea1nh tranh, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t t\u1ea1i c\u00e1c th\u00e0nh ph\u1ed1 l\u1edbn.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BckYdemxKo8H4wxtK2Aloucjgsd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng theo d\u00f5i chi ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> T\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt li\u00ean t\u1ee5c v\u00e0 chi ti\u1ebft trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee, gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng theo d\u00f5i h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh c\u1ee7a g\u00f3i h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-SLGYdF7GJocIxCx4nd3lGLNmgmu\">C\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a Shopee Express<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-MA9bdZaGBoJGnMx0rZtl0Wzvg7d\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;37ad7d2a-fa75-4eee-91c3-fa8ad0760547&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FYvTsb0tl6oySoNx53Wsl8GlCgfb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;YvTsb0tl6oySoNx53Wsl8GlCgfb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:547445,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;37ad7d2a-fa75-4eee-91c3-fa8ad0760547&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FYvTsb0tl6oySoNx53Wsl8GlCgfb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;YvTsb0tl6oySoNx53Wsl8GlCgfb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:547445,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5288\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5288\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5288\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/9ccb9b92-c949-4341-a157-1c7ed6009387.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a Shopee Express\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/9ccb9b92-c949-4341-a157-1c7ed6009387.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/9ccb9b92-c949-4341-a157-1c7ed6009387-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/9ccb9b92-c949-4341-a157-1c7ed6009387-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/9ccb9b92-c949-4341-a157-1c7ed6009387-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/9ccb9b92-c949-4341-a157-1c7ed6009387-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5288\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>C\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a Shopee Express<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"KzYQd3c01oBldQxVk2vl9bOqg1g\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LnfAd5NMJorqyFxYQ5rlAZKBgng\">Shopee Express cung c\u1ea5p m\u1ed9t chu tr\u00ecnh d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\u00e9p k\u00edn \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ea7u \u0111\u1ebfn cu\u1ed1i:<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pt9dd0alzo13F1xsC8KlUb3egye\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 L\u1ea5y h\u00e0ng (First-Mile):<\/strong> Nh\u00e2n vi\u00ean c\u1ee7a Shopee Express s\u1ebd \u0111\u1ebfn tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea5y h\u00e0ng sau khi \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn, sau \u0111\u00f3 chuy\u1ec3n v\u1ec1 c\u00e1c kho ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MsTTd7wHLoJyaWxPv0nl5Zbigse\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 Giao h\u00e0ng (Last-Mile):<\/strong> Sau khi h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd t\u1ea1i c\u00e1c kho, b\u01b0u t\u00e1 s\u1ebd nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 giao tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a Ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OQNhddQalolGeux76UUlX3blgeO\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 Ho\u00e0n h\u00e0ng (Return):<\/strong> Trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua c\u00f3 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng\/ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ea5p thu\u1eadn, Shopee Express s\u1ebd h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh nh\u1eadn l\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua v\u00e0 ho\u00e0n tr\u1ea3 v\u1ec1 cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P9gDdAZTuo4ZTQxvv2Pl2cDcg6f\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 Theo d\u00f5i (Tracking):<\/strong> Cung c\u1ea5p m\u00e3 v\u1eadn \u0111\u01a1n cho m\u1ed7i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng tra c\u1ee9u tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ec3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ki\u1ec3m tra tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i v\u00e0 v\u1ecb tr\u00ed c\u1ee7a \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng b\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 l\u00fac n\u00e0o.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HQDPd6FhgoQNKPxcxDvlVCEjgff\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1ch tra c\u1ee9u \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng Shopee Express<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BdbtdmLrMolFWxxGYjWl4xv2gXc\">Vi\u1ec7c theo d\u00f5i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng h\u01a1n trong vi\u1ec7c s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp th\u1eddi gian nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tra c\u1ee9u b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch sau:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-YaIUdjvyEo6xUgxphSMlkCkRgMe\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: L\u1ea5y m\u00e3 v\u1eadn \u0111\u01a1n<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-DhACdLfNxor5OUxC3T6lM7Ujgqh\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;b8da962f-0ce5-45d0-b2f0-2417e11e9995&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FLE4bbLJ0OorSzgxvkhsl0CGIgbh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;LE4bbLJ0OorSzgxvkhsl0CGIgbh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:148812,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;b8da962f-0ce5-45d0-b2f0-2417e11e9995&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FLE4bbLJ0OorSzgxvkhs