; &gt; &#8220;<strong>\u0110\u01a1n mua<\/strong>&#8220;.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U2SDdeaBHoU7ZoxfNnilGHdwg2g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n tra c\u1ee9u.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pr0MdZ9bGoQi1rx3KkalSUzMg3g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Trong m\u1ee5c &#8220;<strong>Th\u00f4ng tin v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n<\/strong>&#8220;, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd th\u1ea5y m\u00e3 v\u1eadn \u0111\u01a1n (th\u01b0\u1eddng b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u b\u1eb1ng SPX&#8230;). H\u00e3y sao ch\u00e9p m\u00e3 n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-E4H2dmCvsorz3WxRwB2lCtoVgwe\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Truy c\u1eadp h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng tra c\u1ee9u sau \u0111\u00f3 Nh\u1eadp m\u00e3 v\u00e0 xem k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-YbxcdfRY4oqPLrx4XmUlEZ7wg3g\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d872f75c-1cf3-4800-ad32-e8c5370c492e&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FAo3eb94RKovHSgxCVrplAtAmg0g%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Ao3eb94RKovHSgxCVrplAtAmg0g&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:113526,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d872f75c-1cf3-4800-ad32-e8c5370c492e&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FAo3eb94RKovHSgxCVrplAtAmg0g%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Ao3eb94RKovHSgxCVrplAtAmg0g&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:113526,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5290\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5290\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5290\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/efe19a3c-65cc-403f-8c34-d3a659903343.png\" alt=\"Truy c\u1eadp h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng tra c\u1ee9u sau \u0111\u00f3 Nh\u1eadp m\u00e3 v\u00e0 xem k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/efe19a3c-65cc-403f-8c34-d3a659903343.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/efe19a3c-65cc-403f-8c34-d3a659903343-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/efe19a3c-65cc-403f-8c34-d3a659903343-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/efe19a3c-65cc-403f-8c34-d3a659903343-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/efe19a3c-65cc-403f-8c34-d3a659903343-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5290\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Truy c\u1eadp h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng tra c\u1ee9u sau \u0111\u00f3 Nh\u1eadp m\u00e3 v\u00e0 xem k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"KzYQd3c01oBldQxVk2vl9bOqg1g\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XbgyddHzMoig7exyrcFllhGlg1d\">Truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o trang web tra c\u1ee9u v\u1eadn \u0111\u01a1n ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a Shopee Express t\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/spx.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/spx.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ARXNdjCLqo7TGExWxlDl9rHPgMd\">D\u00e1n m\u00e3 v\u1eadn \u0111\u01a1n b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 sao ch\u00e9p \u1edf B\u01b0\u1edbc 1 v\u00e0o \u00f4 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm tr\u00ean trang web v\u00e0 nh\u1ea5n &#8220;<strong>Theo d\u00f5i h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh<\/strong>&#8220;. To\u00e0n b\u1ed9 l\u1ecbch s\u1eed v\u00e0 tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb chi ti\u1ebft.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JXj3dXdLXo6obIxnoxBl6i0hgGe\"><strong>M\u1eb9o nh\u1ecf: Hi\u1ec3u c\u00e1c tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SdH7dUKK1o3HKBxuHxVlRyptgMd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebfp nh\u1eadn:<\/strong> Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i xong v\u00e0 \u0111ang ch\u1edd Shopee Express \u0111\u1ebfn l\u1ea5y h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ENtOdBr14onG8uxKR3slobzagob\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ebfn kho ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i:<\/strong> G\u00f3i h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n v\u1ec1 kho trung t\u00e2m \u0111\u1ec3 x\u1eed l\u00fd v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u ph\u1ed1i \u0111i c\u00e1c t\u1ec9nh th\u00e0nh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BzlkdZc5bovsEAxdG8ilrYHbgc5\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111ang \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n:<\/strong> G\u00f3i h\u00e0ng \u0111ang tr\u00ean \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng t\u1eeb kho n\u00e0y \u0111\u1ebfn kho kh\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EbNvd3dL4oabxTxtkedlXI3bgMc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ebfn kho giao:<\/strong> G\u00f3i h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e3 v\u1ec1 \u0111\u1ebfn kho t\u1ea1i khu v\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n v\u00e0 s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ec3 giao.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JFW9dCEQgoG6pExWnFfll3Jygdb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nh\u00e2n vi\u00ean giao h\u00e0ng \u0111ang giao \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ebfn b\u1ea1n:<\/strong> B\u01b0u t\u00e1 \u0111\u00e3 nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 s\u1ebd giao cho b\u1ea1n trong ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BZdFd2RiEoC30tx2yRYlUCb1gUg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Giao h\u00e0ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Vak0d8CQAo8U5qxJFL3lgVX3gdb\">C\u00e1ch t\u00ecm b\u01b0u c\u1ee5c\/\u0111i\u1ec3m g\u1eedi h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a Shopee Express<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YwFRdzb9joNGEgxrRNCljB1pgjg\">Vi\u1ec7c t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm b\u01b0u c\u1ee5c l\u00e0 c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft khi b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n c\u1ea7n g\u1eedi h\u00e0ng, ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp, ho\u1eb7c c\u1ea7n x\u1eed l\u00fd c\u00e1c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PhfkdKQEnoNbDQxehfmlSijag2g\">C\u00e1ch \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 nh\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n nay l\u00e0:<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M688dFdORoTDiex2NW7ljdjHgCj\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>M\u1edf \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng <strong>Google Maps<\/strong> tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i ho\u1eb7c m\u00e1y t\u00ednh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HenKdGwHbomhNhxCUOblGOUegDg\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Tr\u00ean thanh t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm, g\u00f5 t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a: <code>b\u01b0u c\u1ee5c Shopee Express<\/code> ho\u1eb7c <code>\u0111i\u1ec3m g\u1eedi h\u00e0ng Shopee Express<\/code>.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L270dfXSXon2O3xEOrsl0sENgrb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Google Maps s\u1ebd hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb danh s\u00e1ch c\u00e1c b\u01b0u c\u1ee5c g\u1ea7n v\u1ecb tr\u00ed c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n nh\u1ea5t k\u00e8m theo th\u00f4ng tin chi ti\u1ebft v\u1ec1 <strong>\u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9, gi\u1edd l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c, v\u00e0 ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0wedYmxyomMtJxxDwblYHW8gpd\">B\u1ea1n n\u00ean xem k\u1ef9 gi\u1edd l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c c\u1ee7a b\u01b0u c\u1ee5c tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh m\u1ea5t th\u1eddi gian.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-NkkZd3MX8oRLGPxKFealrN3kg3f\">M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xbr7dsXX5oFwSDxNuyVlVtSmgce\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Shopee Express c\u00f3 l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c cu\u1ed1i tu\u1ea7n kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong> C\u00f3. Shopee Express l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c c\u1ea3 th\u1ee9 B\u1ea3y v\u00e0 Ch\u1ee7 Nh\u1eadt (tr\u1eeb c\u00e1c ng\u00e0y l\u1ec5, T\u1ebft theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh). \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y gi\u00fap r\u00fat ng\u1eafn th\u1eddi gian giao h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e1ng k\u1ec3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WsZgdxONtokrzJx15aPlpPLwgrX\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Th\u1eddi gian giao h\u00e0ng Shopee Express m\u1ea5t bao l\u00e2u?<\/strong> Th\u1eddi gian giao h\u00e0ng ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o kho\u1ea3ng c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ecba l\u00fd gi\u1eefa ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I9rzdfGtfoPIBKxmMctl1brQgrc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>N\u1ed9i t\u1ec9nh\/th\u00e0nh ph\u1ed1:<\/strong> Th\u01b0\u1eddng t\u1eeb 1-2 ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KFwZdnmmPo9z8JxwNxhlSlR4gNP\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Li\u00ean t\u1ec9nh:<\/strong> Th\u01b0\u1eddng t\u1eeb 3-5 ng\u00e0y. Th\u1eddi gian n\u00e0y l\u00e0 d\u1ef1 ki\u1ebfn v\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00f9y thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OlhGd8cvWowdmwxQ9PKlLdMhgPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>X\u1eed l\u00fd nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o khi \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng Shopee Express b\u1ecb giao tr\u1ec5?<\/strong> N\u1ebfu \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng b\u1ecb tr\u1ec5 h\u01a1n so v\u1edbi ng\u00e0y giao d\u1ef1 ki\u1ebfn, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OL8jd811DoM48uxNNpUlU6NXg0f\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Ki\u1ec3m tra l\u1ea1i h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ec3 xem c\u00f3 v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 g\u00ec b\u1ea5t th\u01b0\u1eddng kh\u00f4ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CR36dIkyvomA3qxxF94lGVX9gId\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng li\u00ean h\u1ec7 v\u1edbi t\u1ed5ng \u0111\u00e0i Ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a Shopee qua s\u1ed1 <code>1900 1221<\/code> \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 v\u00e0 ki\u1ec3m tra t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yh5Id6m0to4O3vxRxpMlg25tgjh\">Shopee Express \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ee9ng t\u1ecf vai tr\u00f2 kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu trong h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i c\u1ee7a Shopee, mang l\u1ea1i l\u1ee3i \u00edch v\u1ec1 t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng. V\u1edbi c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\u00e9p k\u00edn t\u1eeb l\u1ea5y h\u00e0ng, giao h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ebfn ho\u00e0n h\u00e0ng, \u0111\u00e2y th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n tin c\u1eady.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWCHdymSbouiGQxrSpSl0uKegRd\">B\u1eb1ng vi\u1ec7c n\u1eafm r\u00f5 c\u00e1ch tra c\u1ee9u v\u00e0 c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng tin li\u00ean quan, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m mua s\u1eafm t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t tr\u00ean Shopee.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYzRd0zBGoUrhkxnn1alS8U5g2p\">N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n th\u00eam nhi\u1ec1u h\u01a1n th\u00f4ng tin v\u1ec1 Shopee ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c s\u00e0n TM\u0110T l\u1edbn trong c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 ngo\u00e0i n\u01b0\u1edbc, h\u00e3y theo d\u00f5i k\u00eanh blog ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd nh\u1eadn t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 li\u00ean quan theo c\u00e1c k\u00eanh th\u00f4ng tin b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y c\u1ee7a <strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ISOudYVT6o8zoMxdPetlF99cgsg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NtDndqxI5oPHDCxumP8lZJYKgVe\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lfl6daUtOo2r7NxMhsKlNX1kgKc\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CbmRdnsY0oNFRtx2988lBu4Dgad\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BqpSdwcZjoZ9X5xOjdAlUBzmgVc\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MWa4dzmmboyWgcxR9Eylgl9XgKd\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ei4Td3Ysto0waax8Nj9lWIpxg6f\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shopee Express l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a Shopee s\u1ebd gi\u00fap nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng n\u1eafm b\u1eaft nhi\u1ec1u \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i h\u01a1n \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n n\u00e0y. B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y Lemon Digital s\u1ebd gi\u1ea3i \u0111\u00e1p t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 nh\u1eefng g\u00ec b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n bi\u1ebft v\u1ec1 Shopee Express, t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ecbnh ngh\u0129a, d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5, c\u00e1ch tra [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5703,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[30,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5286","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-shopee","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5286","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5286"}],"v